  "termsSection2Content": "You are specifically restricted from all of the following:\n• using this app in any way that impacts user access or disrupts the chauffeur services;\n• using this app contrary to the applicable laws and regulations of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia;\n• behaving inappropriately towards our chauffeurs or damaging the provided luxury vehicles.",
